                <head>Arbitration convention between the United States and Mexico</head>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Washington, March 24, 1908.
                        Ratification advised by the Senate, April 2, 1908. Ratified by the
                        President, May 29, 1908. Ratified by Mexico, May 30, 1908. Ratifications
                        exchanged at Washington, June 27, 1908. Proclaimed, June 29, 1908</hi>.</p>

